# Warlock set. One line per animation: "<ttfx effect> [ttfx args...]".
# Args tune speed and the effect's own palette; the set's `palettes` file supplies
# --final-gradient-stops for whatever the art settles into.
# `screensaver-set effects` (no args) lists every effect name ttfx accepts;
# `ttfx <effect> --help` lists that effect's options.

# Fire: characters ignite and burn in as pixel embers.
burn --smoke-chance 0.25 --burn-colors ffffff ffd34d ff6b00 c81e00 3a0000
# Embers sprayed up from the bottom that settle into the sigil.
spray --spray-position s --spray-volume 0.04 --movement-speed-range 1.8-3.6
# Fast fel rain resolving into the sigil.
matrix --rain-time 1.5 --resolve-delay 1 --rain-color-gradient ff9d00 ff3b00 5a0d00 --highlight-color ffe9a8
decrypt --typing-speed 10
unstable --explosion-speed 3 --reassembly-speed 3
laseretch --etch-speed 6 --etch-delay 1
smoke --smoke-symbols ░ ▒ ▓ █ --starting-color 3a0000
crumble
blackhole
swarm --swarm-coordination 90
